  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>此內容僅適用於 1.20.4 - 1.21.1 版本。本模組在 NeoForge 上的新版本已<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-jungle-temples\" rel=\"nofollow\">遷移至此處</a>。</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNytodv.png\" alt=\"YUNG's Better Jungle Temples\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"Depends on YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"Join the YUNG GANG on Discord!\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"Follow me on Twitter!\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"Subscribe to my YouTube!\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon!\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ujP2J5g.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p><strong>Minecraft 叢林神廟的全面改造！</strong>YUNG's Better Jungle Temples 從零開始重新設計叢林神廟，帶來全新的設計、陷阱、謎題和戰利品！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG's Better Jungle Temples 內建與許多模組的相容性！如果你使用以下任何模組，神廟的某些部分將有機會生成特殊組件。請注意，這是可選功能——使用 Better Jungle Temples 並不需這些模組。</p><ul>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Alex's Mobs</li>\n</ul><p>YUNG's Better Jungle Temples 也致力於與所有世界生成模組完全相容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-nether-fortresses-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用 Bisect Hosting 並輸入折扣碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG，可享 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
